    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Ashbound Survivors</strong></p><p><em>You’ve learned to make the bad route pay for itself.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on checks made to endure environmental strain, locate shelter, scavenge sustenance, or navigate by ruin-sign, stars, or ashfall.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Failed or costly travel through harsh terrain is less likely to become pure loss; wasteland movement can generate trace gain, salvage, or reduced attrition instead.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
